msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/meta/index.rst:8
msgid "Turn Python classes/methods into TIR, in both eager and lazy modes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/meta/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"Two DSL primitives -- ``inline`` (method -> inlined TIR) and ``meta_class`` "
"(class of JIT-time stateful helpers) -- that behave the same in eager "
"(``@tilelang.jit``) and lazy (``@T.prim_func``) frontends. See each "
"function's docstring for the details."
msgstr ""

