msgid "Module Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/meta/index.rst:33
msgid ""
"``self`` is bound automatically. The lowering engine is chosen per call so "
"the same method works in both frontends:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/meta/index.rst:36
msgid ""
"eager mode (an eager ``Builder`` is active) -> the eager ``macro`` engine;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/meta/index.rst:37
msgid ""
"lazy mode (no eager builder; a TVMScript parser is active) -> TVM's parser-"
"level ``inline`` (``TIRInline``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/meta/index.rst:40
msgid "Both engines are built lazily on first use of the respective mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/meta/index.rst:42
msgid ""
"Inside an inlined method, read scalar state via ``self.x[0]`` and write via "
"``self.x[0] = ...``; the store lowers to ``BufferStore`` through whichever "
"engine is active, so no core builder/parser changes are needed."
msgstr ""

